<h2 id=3D"ScrumTeamMPSYSSuite-SDBAEngagement:"><strong>SDBA Engagement: <br=
></strong></h2>
<p>To create a ticket for <strong>SDBA support</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>Use the following link to submit a ticket for support:&nbsp;<a href=3D"=
https://dbaportal.web.att.com/" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">db=
aportal.web.att.com</a></li>
</ul>
<p>To create a ticket for <strong>Call to Work (C2W)</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Use the following link to submit a ticket for support:&nbsp;<a href=3D"=
http://onetool.it.att.com/c2w/" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">on=
etool.it.att.com</a></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>Refer to DoD or send an email to the database distribution list below:</=
p>
<p><a href=3D"mailto:DXC-MIS-Dbase@dxc.com" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"=
nofollow">DXC-MIS-Dbase@dxc.com</a></p>
<p>If you are experiencing issues and need to reach out immediately, please=
 look up your MOTS ID in the DOD (Database of Databases) tool to determine =
the primary and secondary DBA contact for your MOTS ID:</p>
